    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2270f699",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "target audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a general online audience familiar with internet humor, particularly those who engage with or create misogynistic content. The target community includes individuals who find amusement in mocking women's emotional reactions to relationship betrayal, often reinforcing stereotypes of women as 'crazy' or 'hysterical'. The crude language and exaggerated visual of the woman are intended to resonate with viewers who enjoy or are desensitized to misogynistic tropes, and who may identify with or perpetuate the stereotype that women are overly emotional and irrational in the face of sexual infidelity. The meme’s intent to ridicule women as emotionally fragile makes it primarily targeted at audiences who either endorse or are indifferent to such gender-based stereotypes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
